{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dear Marie,\n\nThis afternoon I arrived in Prague. The journey from Töplitz was tiring, but the change of scene did me good. On Sunday I swam in the Töplitz spring and took a walk in the Clary Park. The air there is pure, and the quiet in the hills near Lowositz refreshed me greatly. I crossed the Eger river twice, the second time by moonlight, which had a strange, silent effect.\n\nNow I am sitting in my room. The city is large and lively, but I miss our four walls in Berlin and the company of the children. Please forgive my absence; the journey was necessary to clear my mind before I think about the next lectures.\n\nGive me news of Karl and Immanuel soon. Kiss me, if you can.\n\nYour\nG. W. F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795221159,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":179,"prompt_tokens":277,"total_tokens":456,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-bwXy3cvWaMavZY57kCOXxCU1aul2rIBB","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":277,"prompt_ms":414.579,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.4966750902527075,"prompt_per_second":668.1476871718056,"predicted_n":179,"predicted_ms":4140.261,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.25989325842697,"predicted_per_second":42.99245868799092}}